CHAPTER.VERS:
Ye that put far away the evil 
        day, and cause the seat of violence to come near; 

          seat: or, habitation

That lie upon beds of ivory, and stretch themselves upon their couches, and eat 
        lambs from the flock, and calves from the midst of the stall; 

          stretch…: or, abound with superfluities

That chant to the sound of the harp, 
        invent to themselves instruments of music, like David; 

          chant: or, quaver
